{
  "registry_id": "workpaper-sync-alerts",
  "registry_version": "workpaper-sync-alerts:v1",
  "schema_version": 1,
  "spec": "workpaper-html-onlyoffice-bidirectional-writeback-closure",
  "task": 29,
  "requirements": ["13.7", "13.9"],
  "purpose": "Requirement 13.9 逐条列举的告警条件的版本化规则表。每条规则必须有阈值、窗口、严重级别、去重键、恢复条件与 runbook；`metric` 必须存在于 metrics.METRIC_CATALOG，且每个 `alert_required=true` 的指标必须恰有一条规则（两侧双向锁死）。",

  "invariants": {
    "one_rule_per_required_metric": true,
    "one_rule_per_condition": true,
    "dedupe_key_subset_of_metric_attribution": true,
    "runbook_required": true,
    "recovery_required": true,
    "no_free_text_severity": true
  },

  "severities": ["info", "warning", "critical"],
  "comparisons": ["count_gte", "gauge_gte", "any_occurrence"],
  "recovery_kinds": ["below_threshold", "explicit_resolution"],

  "rules": [
    {
      "rule_id": "oo_service_unavailable",
      "condition": "onlyoffice_unavailable",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_oo_service_unavailable_total",
      "severity": "critical",
      "comparison": "count_gte",
      "threshold": 3,
      "window_seconds": 300,
      "result_filter": ["connect_error", "timeout", "http_5xx", "invalid_response"],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["room_id", "generation"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "below_threshold", "window_seconds": 900 },
      "runbook": "1) 查 docker 容器 onlyoffice 健康与 8080 端口；2) 确认 ONLYOFFICE_URL 与 JWT secret 未漂移；3) 期间 forcesave 会被拒（AC 4.7），不要手动改 room 指针；4) 恢复后由用户显式 retry，不得让 OO 重发文件。"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "callback_not_delivered",
      "condition": "callback_not_delivered",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_callback_missing_total",
      "severity": "critical",
      "comparison": "count_gte",
      "threshold": 1,
      "window_seconds": 600,
      "result_filter": ["timeout"],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["room_id", "generation", "participant_id"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "explicit_resolution", "window_seconds": 3600 },
      "runbook": "1) accepted 但无 callback：确认 DocServer 能回连 callback route（网络单向可达是最常见原因）；2) 前端必须保持 OO 模式并允许重试（AC 4.4），不得切回后只 reloadAll；3) 不要伪造 durable ack；4) 若文件已在 DocServer 侧 forcesave，走 recovery case 的 authorization-first claim。"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "unmatched_status2",
      "condition": "unmatched_status2",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_unmatched_status2_total",
      "severity": "critical",
      "comparison": "count_gte",
      "threshold": 1,
      "window_seconds": 900,
      "result_filter": ["no_request", "candidate_conflict"],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["room_id", "generation"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "explicit_resolution", "window_seconds": 86400 },
      "runbook": "1) incoming 已 durable 且必须返回 error=0（AC 5.8）；2) 已建 recovery case，claim 前 request/application/operation 必须为 0 —— 核对确实为 0；3) 让有权用户按 prior confirmation 认领，或 download-only 终结；4) 严禁猜 base 直接应用。"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "recovery_backlog",
      "condition": "recovery_backlog",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_recovery_case_total",
      "severity": "warning",
      "comparison": "count_gte",
      "threshold": 5,
      "window_seconds": 3600,
      "result_filter": ["missing_request", "ambiguous_close", "crash_close", "stale_candidate"],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["room_id"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "below_threshold", "window_seconds": 7200 },
      "runbook": "1) 按 room 列出 unclaimed case 与其 reason 分布；2) crash_close 集中说明前端卸载路径没提示用户（AC 4.8）；3) 过期前提醒有权用户 claim；4) 不满足安全条件的只能转 download_only/quarantined/expired。"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "close_intent_singleton_violation",
      "condition": "close_intent_singleton_violation",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_close_capture_total",
      "severity": "critical",
      "comparison": "count_gte",
      "threshold": 2,
      "window_seconds": 60,
      "result_filter": ["promoted"],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["room_id", "generation"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "explicit_resolution", "window_seconds": 86400 },
      "runbook": "1) 同 (room, generation) 出现第二个 promoted close-capture 即违反 AC 4.10 的 exactly-one；2) 先查 partial unique constraint 是否仍在（V151）；3) 核对 reconcile_close_intents() 是否在 room lock 内选 leader；4) 不要手工删 capture —— 先冻结现场，两个 capture 意味着可能已产生两个 application。"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "close_leader_no_successor",
      "condition": "close_leader_no_successor",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_close_leader_recovery_required_total",
      "severity": "warning",
      "comparison": "any_occurrence",
      "threshold": 1,
      "window_seconds": 900,
      "result_filter": ["no_successor"],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["room_id", "generation"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "explicit_resolution", "window_seconds": 86400 },
      "runbook": "1) 这是**显式终态**不是错误：generation 已 supersede，room/intents 落 recovery_required（AC 4.10 / 10.4）；2) durable incoming 必须仍在，核对未被清理；3) 通知重新授权的用户从新 generation 恢复；4) 严禁以 system/route identity 代提交，也不得让它变成永久 retryable_blocked。"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "post_durable_processing_failure",
      "condition": "post_durable_processing_failure",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_post_durable_failure_total",
      "severity": "critical",
      "comparison": "count_gte",
      "threshold": 1,
      "window_seconds": 600,
      "result_filter": ["extract", "merge", "rematerialize", "authorization_fence", "commit"],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["room_id", "generation", "canonical_operation_id"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "explicit_resolution", "window_seconds": 86400 },
      "runbook": "1) callback 已返回 error=0，OO 不会重发（AC 5.7/5.8）；2) incoming 必须保留，canonical pointer 与 content revision 必须不变 —— 逐项核对；3) 修因后由重新授权且未 supersede 的显式 retry 继续；4) quarantined incoming 永不进 retry。"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "permission_or_write_fence_invalidated",
      "condition": "permission_or_write_fence_invalidated",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_permission_fence_invalidated_total",
      "severity": "warning",
      "comparison": "count_gte",
      "threshold": 3,
      "window_seconds": 900,
      "result_filter": ["revoked", "expired", "fence_advanced", "generation_rotated"],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["room_id", "generation", "participant_id"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "below_threshold", "window_seconds": 3600 },
      "runbook": "1) 撤销写 participant 必须先由 OO drop 取证已退出；2) 无法取证则提升 write_fence_epoch、取消 outstanding request 并 supersede generation（AC 10.4）；3) 其余有效用户须在新 generation 重开；4) 频繁 rotate 通常是 permission_epoch 计算抖动，查权限源。"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "definition_bundle_drift",
      "condition": "definition_bundle_drift",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_definition_drift_total",
      "severity": "critical",
      "comparison": "any_occurrence",
      "threshold": 1,
      "window_seconds": 300,
      "result_filter": ["template", "instrumentation", "contract", "bundle", "authority_model"],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["entry_id"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "explicit_resolution", "window_seconds": 86400 },
      "runbook": "1) 漂移必须 fail closed 并指出首个漂移 sheet/field/cell（AC 6.10）；2) 不得继续按旧坐标写格；3) 走 template → instrumentation → contract → bundle → representation 的发布 DAG 重新批准；4) 历史 operation 只读 frozen bundle FK + digest，不得按 alias 重解析。"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "candidate_exposed",
      "condition": "candidate_exposed",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_candidate_exposure_total",
      "severity": "critical",
      "comparison": "any_occurrence",
      "threshold": 1,
      "window_seconds": 60,
      "result_filter": ["resolver", "room", "current_pointer", "evidence"],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["entry_id"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "explicit_resolution", "window_seconds": 86400 },
      "runbook": "1) candidate 永不 current/resolvable（AC 3.4 / 6.18），出现即代码缺陷；2) 立刻确认没有 room 已经加载 candidate artifact；3) 回滚 pointer 到上一个 immutable representation；4) 不要 finalize 来「消掉」告警。"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "candidate_finalize_failure",
      "condition": "candidate_finalize_failure",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_bundle_candidate_finalize_total",
      "severity": "warning",
      "comparison": "count_gte",
      "threshold": 3,
      "window_seconds": 3600,
      "result_filter": ["rejected"],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["entry_id"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "below_threshold", "window_seconds": 7200 },
      "runbook": "1) finalize 被拒时 pointer/revision 必须保持原样（AC 6.18）；2) 逐层核对 approved per-entry contract / authority model / 非空 bundle 是否齐备；3) awaiting_contract 是正常中间态，只有 rejected 计入本规则；4) 严禁原地批量覆盖存量 artifact。"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "refresh_required_backlog",
      "condition": "refresh_required_backlog",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_refresh_required_total",
      "severity": "warning",
      "comparison": "count_gte",
      "threshold": 5,
      "window_seconds": 1800,
      "result_filter": ["entered"],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["room_id", "generation"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "below_threshold", "window_seconds": 3600 },
      "runbook": "1) merged≠incoming 是合法结果，但 room 会拒下一次 forcesave（AC 4.11）；2) 提示用户重开编辑器确认新基线；3) 积压通常意味着前端没有把 refresh_required 显示成独立状态（AC 11.2/11.3）；4) 不得把服务器结果冒充客户端已确认基线。"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "canonical_rematerialize_failure",
      "condition": "canonical_rematerialize_failure",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_rematerialize_failed_total",
      "severity": "critical",
      "comparison": "count_gte",
      "threshold": 1,
      "window_seconds": 600,
      "result_filter": ["roundtrip_mismatch", "unmanaged_region_changed", "publish_failed"],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["entry_id", "canonical_operation_id"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "explicit_resolution", "window_seconds": 86400 },
      "runbook": "1) 反读不等值说明 adapter 契约与模板结构不一致，禁止发布该版本（AC 6.11）；2) HTML 与 OO 会分叉，先冻结该 entry 的 bidirectional 验收；3) 检查 instrumentation 是否改动了受保护部件；4) 失败的 staged artifact 只能进 orphan 流程。"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "outbox_backlog",
      "condition": "outbox_backlog",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_outbox_backlog",
      "severity": "warning",
      "comparison": "gauge_gte",
      "threshold": 200,
      "window_seconds": 900,
      "result_filter": [],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["project_id"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "below_threshold", "window_seconds": 1800 },
      "runbook": "1) 查 Redis 可达性与 outbox_replay_worker 是否在跑；2) 重放不递增 content revision（AC 2.12），可放心重放；3) 耗尽 max_attempts 的行进 DLQ，需人工判定；4) 不要用 logger.warning 掩盖 —— 耐久行本身就是「没有静默丢失」的判据。"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "orphan_retention_backlog",
      "condition": "orphan_retention_backlog",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_orphan_backlog",
      "severity": "info",
      "comparison": "gauge_gte",
      "threshold": 500,
      "window_seconds": 3600,
      "result_filter": [],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["project_id"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "below_threshold", "window_seconds": 7200 },
      "runbook": "1) 引用或 legal hold 不确定时必须保留并告警（AC 5.11），所以本量涨不等于故障；2) 先跑 dry-run 看清单再 apply；3) 二次引用复核发现新引用即保留；4) retention_audit 类自身不可删。"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "windows_file_in_use",
      "condition": "windows_file_in_use",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_windows_file_in_use_total",
      "severity": "warning",
      "comparison": "count_gte",
      "threshold": 3,
      "window_seconds": 900,
      "result_filter": ["staging", "publish", "delete"],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["project_id", "wp_id"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "below_threshold", "window_seconds": 1800 },
      "runbook": "1) `os.replace` 被占用时 content/representation pointer 与 room 基线必须保持不变；2) 常见成因是本机 WPS/Excel 打开了同一文件；3) 诊断码 FILE_IN_USE 已落 operation，可显式 retry；4) 不要改成「删了再写」——那会在失败时留下缺失 artifact 的半成功态。"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "cross_participant_key_reuse",
      "condition": "cross_participant_key_reuse",
      "metric": "workpaper_sync_forcesave_fingerprint_conflict_total",
      "severity": "warning",
      "comparison": "count_gte",
      "threshold": 3,
      "window_seconds": 600,
      "result_filter": ["cross_participant", "cross_kind", "payload_mismatch"],
      "dedupe_key_fields": ["room_id", "generation", "participant_id"],
      "recovery": { "kind": "below_threshold", "window_seconds": 1800 },
      "runbook": "1) 409 是协议要求的拒绝，**不是** error：不得返回旧 request/operation ID（AC 4.1）；2) 反复出现说明前端在跨用户复用 Idempotency-Key，查 bridge 的 key 生成；3) 核对 frozen_request_fingerprint 的比对面是否完整；4) 不要为了消告警放宽唯一范围。"
    }
  ]
}
